; Stronghold (issue #403, a Capture the Flag stage): a closed hall 2016 wide with a tall tower at each end carrying that team's flag,
; a bridge across the middle and a ledge either side. Symmetric left to right. Two teams of up to four start on their own sides.
; Rotation (Stage.mode_weights): weighted 4x for Capture the Flag, and in any other mode dealt into a bag only 30% of the time.
